; Turbulent ripple field - TWO interfering wave sources.
; ONE continuous stroke snaking across the square. Where the two sets of
; rings cross, the rows tangle into each other.
; 150 mm square, 34 rows 4.5 mm apart, 8 and 11 mm wavelengths.
;
;   >>> PLACE THE PEN AT THE BOTTOM-LEFT of the Hilbert square. <<<
;   Same corner as the Hilbert. Different coloured pen.
;
; No pen lifts - the turns at each end are part of the drawing.
